#: data/gsettings/org.gnome.GPaste.gschema.xml:257
msgid ""
"The keyboard shortcut to upload the first element in history to a pastebin "
"service"
msgstr ""
"Scorciatoia da tastiera per caricare il primo elemento nella cronologia in "
"un servizio pastebin"

#: data/gsettings/org.gnome.GPaste.gschema.xml:265
#, fuzzy
msgid "The command uploading an item to a pastebin service"
msgstr "Carica l’elemento attivo in un servizio pastebin"

#: data/gsettings/org.gnome.GPaste.gschema.xml:266
msgid ""
"The item is written to the command’s standard input, and the command must "
"answer the url it uploaded it to -- and nothing else -- on its standard "
"output. It is parsed as a shell command line, so it may carry arguments, but "
"it is not run through a shell: no pipes, no redirections, no globs. "
"wgetpaste, pastebinit and \"nc termbin.com 9999\" all fit this contract. The "
"default needs nothing but curl, and asks it to keep quiet about its progress "
"(-s) while still reporting errors (-S), since anything it writes on standard "
"error ends up in the daemon’s log."
msgstr ""

